Xmpk RTL release candidate

The CV-X-IF interface and instruction infrastructure originate from CVA6:
https://github.com/openhwgroup/cva6

The included upstream files retain the following attribution:
Copyright 2021 Thales DIS design services SAS
Copyright 2024 Thales DIS France SAS
Original Author: Guillaume Chauvon

Xmpk modifies the instruction package, coprocessor ALU, and coprocessor
wrapper to integrate its custom instructions and accelerators.
The added modification notices identify those changes.

Other Xmpk arithmetic and accelerator RTL is included as the adopted
design snapshot. Its release licensing decision is pending.

Supporting tests, instruction interfaces, firmware, CPU integration
patches and FPGA scripts accompany this snapshot. The CPU patch targets
the pinned public CVA6 base and preserves the upstream file notices.
Newly authored support code has no selected release license.

